    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1164">

                <pb facs="0955" n="839" xml:id="pg839"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 312.11/6914.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Acting Consular Agent McPherson to the Secretary of
                        State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Guaymas</hi></placeName>, [<date
                            ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-document-content" calendar="gregorian"
                            notAfter="1915-11-13T23:59:59-05:00"
                            notBefore="1915-11-11T00:00:00-07:05"><hi rendition="#italic">not
                                dated</hi></date><hi rendition="#italic">; received November 13,
                            1915.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Following message just received from Richardson Construction Company,
                    Esperanza.</p>
                <quote rend="blockquote">
                    <p>We have been given no troops for our protection at Los Hornos. Indians killed
                        four Mexicans near Bacum November 10 and residents are deserting region.
                        Indians are reported in block 31 near Antoga this morning. Every one
                        considers situation very grave and adequate protection is absolutely
                        necessary immediately if repetition of Indians’ atrocities of last May is to
                        be avoided.</p>
                </quote>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">McPherson.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
